# Solo maintainer ruleset

## Context and Problem Statement

What ruleset to create


## Considered Options

Just preventions
Code reviews


## Decision Outcome

Chosen option: Just preventions. Deny-push-to-master ruleset in each repo will be adding the following rules: "restrict deletion, "Block force pushes", "Require linear history".

## Consequences
By not having code reviews, all files need to be double checked before pushing to the branch.